      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "value": "<ol>\n<li>\n<p>On the 25th Tammuz&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>\u1e62\u0101li\u1e25 al-Baghd\u0101d\u012b, his turn(?):&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>collected from me by b. al- &hellip;.&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>4 1&frasl;2 dir. ....&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>and a half ....&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>dir. His compound, 6&hellip;.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Paid for wood, 1 dinar ....&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Collected by b. al-Jabb\u0101n</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Work of al-Aqra\u02bf, for two days ....&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>.... earth, and paid for....&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Collected by al-\u1e24\u0101v\u0113r by a note,&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>1 1&frasl;2 dir.&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
